-- ============================================================================
-- FC9 EXPERT DEEP SEED: Corrosion & Integrity, advanced tier.
--
-- Six modules, 26 lessons, 132 questions (15 per module bank plus a 42
-- question final exam). The structure row is GENERATED from the tier's
-- manifest.json rather than hand typed.
--
-- What this tier owns: WHAT THE MODULE HOLDS BACK, AND HOW TO WORK AGAINST A
-- LIMIT ANYWAY. Eleven held items and one withdrawal; a constant that lives in
-- two files and cannot be validated by comparing them; measuring rather than
-- reading an export; what a synthetic golden can prove and what no case can
-- discriminate; the four things an integrity reader looks for and this module
-- does not have; the rate category as a held label; the binding constraint and
-- the order that makes it honest; inversion against the engine's own verdict;
-- and, framed as history in its own module, what this engine used to do.
--
-- THE INVERSION TRAP. `requiredAllowanceMm` is the allowance a NEW line would
-- need. The allowance that reinstates THIS line's design life is larger by
-- exactly the consumed depth, and the Expert capstone is built on a case where
-- that gap is graded.
--
-- The Expert capstone states its uninhibited rate from the operator's
-- inspection record and its stripped film as a condition, so no held constant
-- reaches any graded chain. Four of its six fields are found by bisecting the
-- engine's own verdict, one is a single remaining-life call and one is a ratio
-- of two lives.
-- ============================================================================

